#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.korganizer.appdata.xml:83
msgid "A default To-do calendar can be specified to make creating new to-dos faster and easier with less chance of filing them into the wrong folder. Setting a default Event calendar has been supported for a long time. See the Calendar Manager context menu \"Set as Default Todo Calendar\""
