#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.korganizer.appdata.xml:85
msgid "It is now possible to hide holidays that belong to specific categories, for example to hide religious holidays. See the Categories combobox in the Holidays section of the Time-&gt;Regional tab"
